  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "S2_AI4LCC",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSentinel-2 Land Cover Dataset (Zarr Format)\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains land-cover labels derived from the AI4LCC benchmark dataset and corresponding Sentinel-2 satellite imagery.\nThe original labels and Sentinel-2 were converted into Zarr format to enable efficient storage and scalable access for large geospatial datasets. Sentinel-2 image tiles corresponding to the label locations were added to create a paired dataset suitable for machine learning\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/wtr001/S2_AI4LCC.",
